### What The Probe Does NOT Cover (Explicit Gaps)
- Non-deterministic random vertex jitter in `dt()` when `l1 != 0` (uses unseeded `Math.random()`).
- Non-deterministic smoke vertex placement in `gsmoke()` and `hsmoke()` (uses unseeded `Math.random()`).
- Non-deterministic laser jitter in `d()` for laser types `i = 2, 3, 9, 11` (uses unseeded `Math.random()`).
*(These non-deterministic paths were executed in the probe under `NONDETERMINISTIC` to verify they run without error, but their generated numbers are not asserted per TRANSPILE_SPEC §2d).*
